{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/vue-crystal-bay-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":242,"crm_id":"2796","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Vue","slug":"vue-crystal-bay-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Crystal Bay Development","price":621526,"display_price":"621K","lattitude":25.053464,"longitude":55.2097932,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Vue by Crystal Bay is a modern residential complex with apartments, which consists of 23 floors from the developer Crystal Bay Development.</p><p>The exterior of the building is designed in an industrial style, which emphasizes the strength of the structure through the use of steel as the main material. The facade of the building is a grid structure that gives it a dynamic and modern look.</p><p>The complex offers <strong>apartments with one, two and three bedrooms.</strong></p><p>The interior is designed in a minimalistic, modern style with natural lighting and clean lines. The color palette includes natural shades inspired by landscapes: beige, gray, brown and sand. Beige travertine and walnut wood elements ensure a unified and harmonious style in all rooms.</p><p>Residents of the complex can enjoy a variety of amenities: a spacious lobby with a reception, a yoga area, a modern fitness center, several swimming pools, including a children's pool, an open-air cinema, a barbecue area, a zen garden and mini golf. There are also EV charging stations, a smart waste disposal system, a sustainable water supply system, and smart home technology.</p><p>Vue by Crystal Bay is ideally located close to key attractions. The nearest shopping center is a 10-minute walk away, and popular beaches can be reached within a 15-minute drive.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/12/fvH655XTkmT8CJCYhTfEptt90j3rAAhkda9grsn7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/12/fvH655XTkmT8CJCYhTfEptt90j3rAAhkda9grsn7.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/13/dVMThx4GNrMokOkFjVdlkwpHLwnMzbRNRm3yXsX3.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/13/dVMThx4GNrMokOkFjVdlkwpHLwnMzbRNRm3yXsX3.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/13/j2ZE5mLfti3YIIIaqYWz6xlzt0wGKWmf8zqu4kKh.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/13/j2ZE5mLfti3YIIIaqYWz6xlzt0wGKWmf8zqu4kKh.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/12/z9vfa0TXA9XK5tvojxBtSZEFJsYFilDqhrpgrZtc.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/12/z9vfa0TXA9XK5tvojxBtSZEFJsYFilDqhrpgrZtc.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/12/EW6oEsnYkuwMM5p3P3sbTEUJPgtcw8kej3NQ1roo.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/12/EW6oEsnYkuwMM5p3P3sbTEUJPgtcw8kej3NQ1roo.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/13/K09qTu9t5B7lMp5G3h1hNKonsn8CmDMzgB5Z9OUB.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/13/K09qTu9t5B7lMp5G3h1hNKonsn8CmDMzgB5Z9OUB.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/12/aARXwM2lOu4wYV4OufOkqENHtuoSG6MeM25n9o94.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/12/aARXwM2lOu4wYV4OufOkqENHtuoSG6MeM25n9o94.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2796/images/2024/08/12/ltvEW9Ajb0OsNakCsW3qDx476